### 1. Create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "Toshkent",
  "nameRu": "Ташкент",
  "nameEn": "Tashkent",
  "key": "tashkent",
  "visible": true
}

### 2. Get all
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions?page=0&size=20

### 3. Get by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions/1

### 4. Get by language
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions/lang
Accept-Language: uz

### 5. Update
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": 1,
  "nameUz": "Toshkent shahri",
  "nameRu": "Город Ташкент",
  "nameEn": "Tashkent City",
  "key": "tashkent",
  "visible": true
}

### 6. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/regions/1